cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Calibrated Order-Randomized Rosenblatt Tests
message: If you use this software or the accompanying results, please cite the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pournaderi
    given-names: Mehrdad
    affiliation: Mofid Securities
    email: m.pournaderi@emofid.com
abstract: >-
  Replication code and data for order-randomized Rosenblatt tests: applying the
  Rosenblatt transform under many random coordinate orderings and combining the
  resulting evidence with dependence-robust merging rules, calibrated by a
  re-estimating parametric bootstrap.
keywords:
  - Rosenblatt transformation
  - goodness-of-fit
  - e-values
  - parametric bootstrap
  - false discovery rate
license: MIT
